<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6">
  <%= render FlatPack::PageTitle::Component.new(
    title: "Methods",
    subtitle: "Common categorisable APIs you can call from models, forms, and controllers.",
    variant: :h1
  ) %>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-6 text-(--surface-content-color)">
    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">recording_studio_category_fields</h2>
      <p class="text-(--surface-muted-content-color)">Inspect the categorisable fields declared on the model class.</p>
      <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>Page.recording_studio_category_fields.map(&:attribute_name)
# =&gt; [:status_category_item_recording_id, :topic_category_item_recording_ids]</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Page.status_category_item_recording_id</h2>
      <p class="text-(--surface-muted-content-color)">The categorises declaration defines a class-level accessor that returns the field object, so you can ask it whether it is single or multiple.</p>
      <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>Page.status_category_item_recording_id.single?
    # =&gt; true

    Page.topic_category_item_recording_ids.multiple?
    # =&gt; true</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Page.available_category_groups</h2>
      <p class="text-(--surface-muted-content-color)">Return the category group recordables declared for the model.</p>
      <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>Page.available_category_groups
    # =&gt; [#&lt;RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategoryGroup slug: "page-status"&gt;,
    #     #&lt;RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategoryGroup slug: "page-topics"&gt;]</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold">page.assigned_category_items</h2>
      <p class="text-(--surface-muted-content-color)">Return the category item recordables selected by a page, optionally filtered by category group slug.</p>
      <pre class="overflow-auto rounded-md bg-(--surface-muted-background-color) p-4 text-xs"><code>page.assigned_category_items
# =&gt; [#&lt;RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategoryItem slug: "published"&gt;,
#     #&lt;RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategoryItem slug: "product"&gt;]

page.assigned_category_items(category_group: "page-topics")
# =&gt; [#&lt;RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategoryItem slug: "product"&gt;,
#     #&lt;RecordingStudioCategorisable::CategoryItem slug: "studio"&gt;]</code></pre>
    </section>

  </div>
</div>
